<h2>Errors</h2>
<p>
    I prefer errors as values over exceptions, because it makes control flow predictable.
If using exceptions, a function that can throw an exception should be clearly marked.
</p>

<h2>Big Files</h2>
<p>
    Splitting code into hundreds of files and directories adds complexity.
Big files are better if all the code is related. They're easier to search through.
</p>

